   "definition_quote": "A bit prediction game proceeds as follows. At time $t\\in [T]$ the learner outputs a bit $\\hat{\\gamma}_t \\in \\{0,1\\}$. Then, the learner observes a bit $\\gamma_t \\in \\{0,1\\}$ and suffers a loss of $\\ell(\\hat{\\gamma}_t, \\gamma_t) = \\mathbb{I}\\{\\hat{\\gamma}_t \\neq \\gamma_t\\}$."
